[gd_scene format=3]

; The Vault, under the Coldstacks (map offset (214, -104)): the cold archive's heart, a tall hall of frozen stacks where
; the Archivist keeps everything that was ever copied. Two ways in, both from above or below the pool at its east end:
; breaking the Coldstacks' ice plug (the Drill) drops the pilgrim through the roof into the pool, one way; or it rises
; from the Underice through a low door at the pool's bottom (Ballast both ways). West of the pool, the arena: stepping
; in drops the gates; the Archivist drifts high over the stacks and dives (a boss placeholder). West, the Sanctum.

